WEBVTT

01:41.830 --> 01:48.970
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.390 --> 01:51.960
[Episode 21]

02:04.120 --> 02:06.480
Do you still remember
that insanely difficult

02:06.480 --> 02:08.960
last question from
that year's college entrance exam?

02:08.960 --> 02:11.020
What was the examiner even thinking?

02:13.120 --> 02:14.380
That last question...

02:15.150 --> 02:16.710
I think I vaguely remember it.

02:16.710 --> 02:18.590
It's not hard
once you substitute in logarithms.

02:18.590 --> 02:19.400
Easy for you.

02:20.000 --> 02:20.960
That question

02:21.030 --> 02:23.160
definitely stumped a lot of students.

02:23.320 --> 02:24.910
Didn't you say before,

02:25.470 --> 02:27.310
"After each exam, put it behind you.

02:27.310 --> 02:28.630
Once they're all over, let them go.

02:28.630 --> 02:30.470
Don't dwell on it. Just look ahead."

02:30.470 --> 02:31.280
Yeah.

02:31.750 --> 02:33.350
So you need to look ahead too.

02:33.400 --> 02:35.530
Don't keep staring down at the ground.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.280
Try it.

02:37.710 --> 02:38.120
Come on.

02:38.120 --> 02:38.470
Okay.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.570
Come on, go.

02:43.240 --> 02:44.079
Get lower.

02:44.079 --> 02:45.140
Keep your balance.

02:46.310 --> 02:47.190
Look ahead.

02:47.750 --> 02:48.680
Don't look back.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.329
I'm right here.

02:51.310 --> 02:53.570
Jiang Yubai, look, I can skateboard now!

03:34.740 --> 03:38.320
[Inpatient]

03:40.840 --> 03:41.470
Director.

03:41.630 --> 03:42.400
Come in.

03:44.630 --> 03:45.310
Sit.

03:49.190 --> 03:49.870
Shen,

03:50.360 --> 03:51.079
Dr. Huang

03:51.079 --> 03:52.740
has other duties to attend to.

03:53.030 --> 03:55.430
As for Shui's routine checkups

03:55.450 --> 03:56.380
and ward rounds,

03:56.560 --> 03:58.079
you'll take care of those for now.

03:57.430 --> 03:58.590
[Assessment and Plan for Today]

03:58.620 --> 04:01.080
[Examining Physician's Signature]

04:01.680 --> 04:02.470
She's had

04:02.590 --> 04:05.250
8 different examining doctors
in just 6 months?

04:05.590 --> 04:06.560
In our department,

04:06.560 --> 04:07.400
examining doctors

04:07.400 --> 04:09.330
are supposed to rotate regularly.

04:09.430 --> 04:11.120
You just started your residency here.

04:11.120 --> 04:12.080
Learning more

04:12.240 --> 04:13.280
about different diseases

04:13.280 --> 04:14.240
will do you good.

04:15.190 --> 04:17.630
Do I need to attend the case discussions?

04:20.160 --> 04:22.240
Examining doctors don't need to.

04:25.950 --> 04:26.630
Director,

04:27.390 --> 04:28.950
APL is a rare disease,

04:29.160 --> 04:31.240
so I'd like to study it in depth.

04:35.870 --> 04:36.510
Alright.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.730
[Doctor's signature, Shen Fuxuan]

04:45.560 --> 04:46.360
Shen,

04:47.240 --> 04:48.159
Shui

04:48.430 --> 04:49.630
is a bit of a princess.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.680
Be mindful of your approach

04:51.680 --> 04:52.950
when treating her.

04:55.430 --> 04:57.030
Okay, I'll keep that in mind.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.750
Director, I'll get back to work then.

04:59.750 --> 05:00.430
Okay.

05:08.360 --> 05:10.040
The teacher asked me
to bring these to you.

05:10.040 --> 05:11.270
Read them when you have time

05:11.270 --> 05:13.930
so you won't fall too far behind
in your studies.

05:14.750 --> 05:15.750
Leave them there.

05:16.480 --> 05:17.600
So annoying.

05:17.870 --> 05:19.430
I'm already stuck lying here.

05:19.430 --> 05:21.630
How am I supposed to feel like studying?

05:22.270 --> 05:25.200
No need to guess.
It was definitely my parents' idea.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.870
Then let me show you something good.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.270
What is it?

05:36.630 --> 05:38.720
Our class has a new intern teacher,

05:38.720 --> 05:39.430
Mr. Wang.

05:39.510 --> 05:40.950
He's very handsome.

05:41.310 --> 05:42.120
Look.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.510
Hurry up and get better.

05:44.510 --> 05:45.870
Then you can see him
when you go back to school.

05:45.870 --> 05:46.680
This guy?

05:47.430 --> 05:48.630
Only someone like you

05:48.630 --> 05:49.890
who hasn't met many men

05:50.460 --> 05:51.920
would think he's all that.

05:52.680 --> 05:54.210
As if you've seen that many.

06:07.510 --> 06:08.510
What do you think?

06:11.190 --> 06:13.910
He looks like a runway model.

06:13.950 --> 06:15.970
And his name is so nice too—

06:16.080 --> 06:17.390
Shen Fuxuan.

06:17.830 --> 06:20.430
It means "basking in the sun in winter

06:20.510 --> 06:22.710
and bathing in spring water in summer."

06:23.000 --> 06:24.160
How cultured.

06:24.700 --> 06:25.920
Yeah, sure.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.020
He really is pretty handsome.

06:28.270 --> 06:29.160
However,

06:29.630 --> 06:31.000
Mr. Wang

06:31.040 --> 06:33.100
graduated from Qingbei University.

06:33.390 --> 06:34.680
Where did

06:34.680 --> 06:36.510
this Dr. Shen of yours graduate from?

06:36.510 --> 06:37.870
Oh, him?

06:39.480 --> 06:40.750
Nothing special.

06:41.360 --> 06:43.290
Johns Hopkins School of Medicine.

06:43.870 --> 06:44.950
Really?

06:48.510 --> 06:49.800
Then, is he...

06:49.920 --> 06:50.720
single?

06:51.600 --> 06:52.830
I don't know either.

06:52.830 --> 06:53.480
You...

06:57.870 --> 06:58.510
Shui,

06:58.600 --> 06:59.750
starting today,

06:59.750 --> 07:02.040
I'll be responsible for
your routine checkups.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.320
Really, Dr. Shen?

07:03.360 --> 07:04.160
You agreed with Director Zhou

07:04.160 --> 07:06.960
that you'd handle
my routine checkups from now on?

07:07.600 --> 07:08.430
That's great.

07:08.830 --> 07:10.770
I'll take you for a blood test now.

07:11.160 --> 07:11.870
Let's go.

07:43.430 --> 07:45.310
Hello, are you Jiang Yubai?

07:47.159 --> 07:47.870
Yes.

07:48.390 --> 07:49.450
What's the matter?

07:52.240 --> 07:53.310
This is my badge.

07:53.870 --> 07:54.680
There is something

07:54.680 --> 07:56.120
we need to confirm with you.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.120
We'd appreciate your cooperation.

07:59.430 --> 08:00.120
Okay.

08:24.920 --> 08:25.980
Something came up.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.640
Let's meet another day.

08:31.980 --> 08:36.900
[Okay.]

09:05.510 --> 09:07.640
Do you know why we brought you in today?

09:10.510 --> 09:11.600
Don't be nervous.

09:12.000 --> 09:13.600
It's just a routine inquiry.

09:14.200 --> 09:14.960
Recently,

09:14.960 --> 09:16.600
a batch of rebranded speakers

09:16.600 --> 09:18.130
has appeared on the market.

09:18.390 --> 09:21.030
They look almost
exactly like the originals.

09:21.600 --> 09:23.080
We traced them back to the source

09:23.080 --> 09:25.120
and found a guy named Cheng.

09:25.870 --> 09:27.400
Take a look at these photos.

09:33.380 --> 09:33.980
Jiang,

09:34.030 --> 09:35.600
they're really not for private labeling.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.630
They will never end up on the market.

09:38.550 --> 09:40.550
It's just that some vain rich kids

09:41.510 --> 09:42.720
want something unique,

09:42.720 --> 09:45.580
with a mystery to it
they can't quite put into words.

09:49.200 --> 09:51.720
I guarantee
it won't damage your reputation.

09:51.720 --> 09:53.650
And this order is very profitable.

09:54.600 --> 09:57.800
It'd also get you out of the tight spot
you're in right now.

09:58.750 --> 10:01.000
[Repayment Plan for the Next Three Months]

10:04.480 --> 10:05.240
Officer.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.380
Cheng is my business partner.

10:09.000 --> 10:09.860
Our workshop's

10:09.910 --> 10:12.310
operating model is actually quite simple.

10:12.630 --> 10:14.430
Cheng is mainly responsible for

10:14.720 --> 10:16.030
communicating with clients

10:16.030 --> 10:17.490
and selling our products.

10:18.150 --> 10:20.870
I'm mainly responsible for
the technology and production.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.200
I'm almost never involved in

10:22.200 --> 10:23.860
the front-end sales process.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.360
About 2 weeks ago...

10:29.600 --> 10:31.800
Cheng did mention an urgent order to me.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.900
The quantity was quite large,

10:33.960 --> 10:36.000
but there was a special requirement.

10:36.000 --> 10:38.510
That is, none of the products could have

10:38.510 --> 10:40.510
our workshop's logo or mark on them.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.630
I explicitly asked him at the time

10:42.630 --> 10:44.510
what this batch of products was for.

10:44.510 --> 10:45.870
But he assured me

10:46.200 --> 10:49.460
it was solely based on
the customer's personal preference

10:50.360 --> 10:54.890
and that there was absolutely no risk
of rebranding or counterfeiting involved.

10:54.960 --> 10:57.030
We've trusted each other for years,

10:58.360 --> 11:00.160
so I didn't look into it further.

11:03.030 --> 11:05.150
So, what you're saying is...

11:05.720 --> 11:08.150
you had no knowledge of this matter?

11:08.510 --> 11:09.270
Yes.

11:09.720 --> 11:12.720
You can ask Cheng
for the customer's information

11:12.720 --> 11:14.480
and details of the order.

11:26.100 --> 11:26.650
Okay.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.360
We basically

11:37.360 --> 11:38.720
have a clear picture of what happened.

11:38.720 --> 11:39.920
That's all for today.

11:40.240 --> 11:42.750
We'll be in touch
if there's anything further.

11:42.750 --> 11:44.150
Get a family member to sign the paperwork,

11:44.150 --> 11:45.480
and then you can go home.

11:52.200 --> 11:53.000
Family...

11:55.600 --> 11:56.930
I don't have any family.

12:02.720 --> 12:03.390
Then...

12:04.150 --> 12:05.270
call a friend.

12:07.600 --> 12:08.490
I...

12:09.510 --> 12:11.240
Don't have any friends either?

12:22.200 --> 12:22.960
Officer,

12:24.240 --> 12:25.500
I'd like to make a call.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.840
-Hello, officer.
-Hello.

12:38.870 --> 12:39.750
I'm looking for Jiang Yubai.

12:39.750 --> 12:40.510
I'm his friend.

12:40.510 --> 12:41.510
He just called me.

12:43.490 --> 12:45.600
[Loyalty, Service to the People,
Professionalism, Efficiency]

12:43.600 --> 12:45.660
This lady is looking for Jiang Yubai.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.900
You're Jiang Yubai's friend, right?

12:48.200 --> 12:48.870
Yes.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.510
We're just following routine procedure

12:50.510 --> 12:51.270
and conducting an inquiry.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.390
It's finished now.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.030
Please sign here,

12:54.030 --> 12:55.430
and you can take him home.

13:00.600 --> 13:02.400
Thank you for your cooperation.

13:02.960 --> 13:03.630
Let's go.

13:15.960 --> 13:16.750
Lin Zhixia...

13:16.750 --> 13:18.720
Jiang Yubai, I need to commend you.

13:19.720 --> 13:20.510
Commend you?

13:21.260 --> 13:22.520
You've made progress.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.750
When you texted

13:25.750 --> 13:27.280
about meeting another day,

13:27.510 --> 13:30.040
weren't you trying to
hide this from me again?

13:31.080 --> 13:33.750
But in the end,
you still let me come pick you up.

13:34.390 --> 13:36.000
That's real progress.

13:37.600 --> 13:38.360
So,

13:39.270 --> 13:40.600
as a reward...

13:44.240 --> 13:45.370
Strawberry crepes.

13:46.510 --> 13:47.570
You must be hungry.

14:03.030 --> 14:04.090
Just what I needed.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.330
I really am hungry.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.850
Is it good?

14:09.600 --> 14:11.360
I just bought them from a random shop.

14:11.360 --> 14:12.750
Have something to hold you over for now.

14:12.750 --> 14:13.600
It's good.

14:14.000 --> 14:15.720
Next time, I'll take you
to a place I've been to.

14:15.720 --> 14:16.980
Their food is good too.

14:18.510 --> 14:19.200
Okay.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.270
What?

14:46.000 --> 14:47.130
You got cream on you.

14:49.180 --> 14:54.590
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

14:56.310 --> 15:02.110
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

15:03.120 --> 15:08.900
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

15:08.920 --> 15:10.130
You got some there too.

15:10.130 --> 15:16.150
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

15:13.840 --> 15:14.720
No, I didn't.

15:15.720 --> 15:17.510
Yeah, a big smudge.

15:18.450 --> 15:24.860
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

15:20.000 --> 15:20.960
You're lying.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.840
How could I lie to you?

15:24.600 --> 15:25.720
Then you got some here too.

15:25.530 --> 15:31.110
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

15:26.840 --> 15:27.840
Here too.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.720
And here too.

15:31.920 --> 15:34.730
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

15:35.380 --> 15:38.410
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

15:38.900 --> 15:41.090
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

15:41.530 --> 15:45.150
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

15:45.920 --> 15:48.260
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

15:49.240 --> 15:51.970
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

15:52.740 --> 15:55.170
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

15:58.080 --> 15:59.150
-Su Mo!
-Su Mo!

15:59.210 --> 16:01.030
Su, whatever it is, you can tell us!

16:01.030 --> 16:02.200
We'll help you figure something out!

16:02.200 --> 16:03.120
Don't do this!

16:03.120 --> 16:03.840
Su Mo!

16:03.840 --> 16:04.480
On the rooftop.

16:04.480 --> 16:05.410
Yeah, that's it.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.630
-Tingting.
-Tingting.

16:06.630 --> 16:07.360
Tingting.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.360
-Tingting.
-Tingting, you're finally here.

16:09.360 --> 16:10.390
Your Su Mo is going to
jump off the building.

16:09.860 --> 16:15.010
[Star Shine Media]

16:10.390 --> 16:11.750
You need to go to the rooftop right now.

16:11.750 --> 16:12.240
Go take a look.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.150
-He's jumping off the building.
-Let's go.

16:13.150 --> 16:14.410
Jump off the building?

16:15.120 --> 16:16.510
-Su Mo, calm down!
-Su Mo!

16:16.510 --> 16:17.360
Yeah, whatever you need,

16:17.360 --> 16:18.270
the company will make sure you get it!

16:18.270 --> 16:19.630
Don't do anything stupid!

16:19.630 --> 16:20.390
Su Mo, what are you doing?

16:20.390 --> 16:21.520
Come down right now!

16:28.480 --> 16:29.150
Wei Ningning.

16:29.150 --> 16:30.280
Who is Wei Ningning?

16:31.120 --> 16:32.470
If I jump from here,

16:33.360 --> 16:34.750
will I no longer have to endure

16:34.750 --> 16:36.480
all the pain you've brought me?

16:36.720 --> 16:37.390
Who is he talking about?

16:37.390 --> 16:38.360
No idea.

16:40.120 --> 16:40.960
I know.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.720
I know everything.

16:45.030 --> 16:46.490
As long as I jump from here,

16:47.510 --> 16:49.360
all that pain will disappear.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.860
It's fine. You can go back now.

16:53.000 --> 16:54.360
Su Mo, get down!

16:54.720 --> 16:56.850
I'll go over that scene with you again.

16:58.120 --> 16:59.270
He's just practicing his lines.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.870
It's nothing. It's nothing.

17:01.910 --> 17:02.870
He scared the hell out of me.

17:02.870 --> 17:04.200
Let's go back. Let's go.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.680
You brat,

17:13.069 --> 17:14.670
you scared the wits out of me.

17:16.550 --> 17:17.920
I just couldn't find the right feeling

17:17.920 --> 17:19.240
for that scene,

17:19.829 --> 17:21.690
so I thought I'd try it out myself.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.800
Tingting, you know what?

17:23.960 --> 17:25.960
The moment I turned my head just now,

17:26.589 --> 17:28.450
I truly felt like I had become him.

17:43.680 --> 17:46.480
Your emotional delivery just now
was pretty good.

17:46.510 --> 17:47.920
But that last part,

17:48.160 --> 17:49.890
you could tone it down a little.

17:56.200 --> 17:58.240
Mr. Li, I'm not going to manage Bingbing.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.240
I'll definitely make Su Mo

17:59.240 --> 18:01.040
one of the best actors out there.

18:04.440 --> 18:05.070
Tingting.

18:05.920 --> 18:07.180
What are you busy with?

18:09.750 --> 18:10.510
Nothing.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.030
I'm telling you,

18:12.030 --> 18:13.680
you need to step up your game from now on.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.340
I've sacrificed a lot for you.

18:18.200 --> 18:20.000
Go get everyone some coffee or something.

18:20.000 --> 18:21.550
You scared everyone half to death
just now.

18:21.550 --> 18:22.200
Okay.

18:23.640 --> 18:24.160
Got it.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.640
Don't ever do that again.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.510
Got it!

18:33.510 --> 18:35.200
We're holding a welcome dinner
for Shen tonight.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.600
Don't forget, everyone.

18:39.310 --> 18:42.570
Alright, whoever's late today
gets punished with a drink.

18:49.920 --> 18:51.160
It's been a long time, Shen!

18:51.160 --> 18:52.720
-It's been a long time.
-You're here.

18:52.720 --> 18:53.830
Tang,

18:54.030 --> 18:55.590
all dressed up so nicely

18:55.720 --> 18:56.790
for Shen's welcome dinner?

18:56.790 --> 18:58.240
Do you really need to be this formal?

18:58.240 --> 19:00.970
Mind your own business.
I didn't dress up for you.

19:01.720 --> 19:02.400
You two

19:02.400 --> 19:04.530
haven't changed a bit all these years.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.330
Where's Lin Zhixia?

19:08.750 --> 19:09.920
She's rarely late.

19:11.960 --> 19:13.510
Traffic might be a bit heavy at this hour.

19:13.510 --> 19:14.240
No rush.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.400
Jin Baihui,

19:18.550 --> 19:20.510
you've spent more than 10 years in school.

19:20.510 --> 19:22.110
Aren't you bored with it yet?

19:22.440 --> 19:23.350
I'm used to it.

19:23.440 --> 19:25.440
Besides, it suits me.

19:25.680 --> 19:26.540
What about you?

19:26.590 --> 19:28.160
Are you in your comfort zone now?

19:28.160 --> 19:29.590
I wouldn't call it my comfort zone.

19:29.590 --> 19:32.270
It's more like my domain.

19:35.200 --> 19:35.920
Shen,

19:36.270 --> 19:38.680
well, is there any fundamental difference

19:38.680 --> 19:39.960
between seeing patients abroad

19:39.960 --> 19:41.920
and seeing patients here in China?

19:41.920 --> 19:43.440
Tell us about it.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.440
Shen.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.570
After coming back,

19:56.590 --> 19:59.050
are you settling in well
at the new hospital?

19:59.440 --> 20:00.300
I can handle it.

20:01.510 --> 20:03.170
I mostly just missed you guys.

20:03.200 --> 20:03.920
Come on.

20:03.920 --> 20:05.240
Please, cut it out.

20:07.200 --> 20:08.590
Traffic was bad, so I'm late.

20:08.590 --> 20:09.590
Sorry about that.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.410
You're here.

20:11.510 --> 20:12.590
Shen Fuxuan.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.190
Welcome back to the team.

20:18.510 --> 20:20.510
I've brought a surprise for you all.

20:28.790 --> 20:29.680
Jiang?

20:30.160 --> 20:30.960
Jiang Yubai?

20:32.960 --> 20:34.400
You finally showed up!

20:34.920 --> 20:36.250
I've missed you so much.

20:38.310 --> 20:40.770
Where on earth
have you been all these years?

20:40.920 --> 20:42.750
You just left us all hanging there

20:42.750 --> 20:43.790
without any explanation

20:43.790 --> 20:44.960
and then abandoned us

20:44.960 --> 20:46.220
like we didn't matter.

20:49.510 --> 20:50.310
Feel my heart.

20:50.920 --> 20:51.720
It's

20:52.310 --> 20:54.200
freezing cold and empty.

20:55.200 --> 20:57.200
Duan Qiyan, you're so cheesy.

20:58.000 --> 20:59.030
Jiang Yubai,

20:59.070 --> 21:00.440
we have to punish you today.

21:00.440 --> 21:02.840
You'd better figure out
how to handle this.

21:03.860 --> 21:05.170
Sorry, guys.

21:05.510 --> 21:06.720
I'm late.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.000
Come sit down.

21:09.000 --> 21:11.160
Yeah, at least you showed up.

21:11.510 --> 21:13.070
-Sit, everybody.
-You girls take the inside seats.

21:13.070 --> 21:14.200
I missed you so much.

21:15.310 --> 21:17.110
Waiter, another chair, please!

21:38.790 --> 21:39.990
It's been a long time.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.770
Yeah, it's been a long time.

21:44.270 --> 21:45.070
You...

21:46.240 --> 21:47.570
haven't changed at all.

21:50.440 --> 21:51.200
Jiang,

21:51.680 --> 21:53.310
since we finally got together today,

21:53.310 --> 21:54.270
tell us

21:54.310 --> 21:56.030
where you've been for the past five years

21:56.030 --> 21:57.560
and what you've been doing.

22:07.200 --> 22:07.920
I...

22:10.510 --> 22:12.370
Something happened in my family.

22:13.200 --> 22:15.060
You might have heard about it too.

22:16.230 --> 22:17.490
I didn't go to college.

22:19.200 --> 22:21.200
My family owed a lot of money back then.

22:21.200 --> 22:21.830
I was...

22:22.510 --> 22:24.750
taking odd jobs to pay off the debt.

22:37.200 --> 22:38.240
But don't worry.

22:38.680 --> 22:40.010
It's almost sorted now.

22:40.440 --> 22:43.510
I also got a bachelor's degree
through self-study exams.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.910
That's exactly why we say

22:45.240 --> 22:47.440
you can do anything you set your mind to.

22:48.680 --> 22:50.610
What are your plans for the future?

22:51.440 --> 22:52.700
I haven't decided yet.

22:53.440 --> 22:55.240
I guess I'll continue studying.

22:56.000 --> 22:57.000
These past years,

22:57.440 --> 22:58.840
I've made you guys worry.

22:59.310 --> 23:00.440
I'm really sorry.

23:01.720 --> 23:02.920
Don't think too much.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.160
It's fine.

23:07.150 --> 23:07.820
By the way,

23:08.200 --> 23:10.330
I brought gifts for you guys this time.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.160
Gifts?

23:14.720 --> 23:15.440
Shen.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.270
What good gift did you get me?

23:17.270 --> 23:18.400
Hurry up and show me.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.480
Here they are.

23:25.730 --> 23:26.680
This is a book, right?

23:26.680 --> 23:28.000
It's heavy and solid.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.510
No need to guess.

23:30.750 --> 23:31.550
It's for me?

23:34.510 --> 23:36.510
This isn't that collection album, is it?

23:36.510 --> 23:37.440
You found it?

23:37.830 --> 23:38.590
I did.

23:39.240 --> 23:40.200
Thanks.

23:41.590 --> 23:43.450
This is a bag of cosmetics, right?

23:44.790 --> 23:45.590
Tang.

23:45.830 --> 23:47.510
Thanks, my dear Shen.

23:47.510 --> 23:48.510
You really get me.

23:54.750 --> 23:57.610
The latest 4th-generation
handheld game console.

23:58.680 --> 23:59.740
No way, seriously?

24:00.440 --> 24:01.700
What's so surprising?

24:02.000 --> 24:04.510
This hasn't even been released
in the country yet.

24:04.510 --> 24:05.920
You're such a good friend.

24:05.920 --> 24:06.920
Thanks, Shen.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.510
Sorry.

24:11.960 --> 24:13.550
I didn't know you were coming, so...

24:13.550 --> 24:14.240
It's fine.

24:15.920 --> 24:17.650
I'll make it up to you next time.

24:31.200 --> 24:33.510
I noticed you've been wearing that watch
for a long time,

24:33.510 --> 24:35.830
so I bought you the latest model.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.000
Take a look.

24:41.030 --> 24:42.200
It's so pretty.

24:43.830 --> 24:44.960
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

24:47.400 --> 24:49.460
I'll definitely take good care of it.

25:07.510 --> 25:09.000
Alright, since Shen is back

25:09.000 --> 25:10.460
and Jiang has rejoined us,

25:10.680 --> 25:11.790
let's have a toast together.

25:11.790 --> 25:12.850
-Cheers!
-Come on.

25:13.310 --> 25:14.160
Lin Zhixia.

25:15.680 --> 25:17.610
Aren't you going to say something?

25:27.510 --> 25:28.510
What's past

25:29.200 --> 25:30.070
is prologue.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.920
Well said, Zhixia.

25:34.030 --> 25:35.510
What's past

25:35.750 --> 25:37.430
is prologue.

25:37.550 --> 25:38.920
Come on, cheers!

25:54.000 --> 25:56.130
This reunion dinner after years apart

25:56.960 --> 25:59.350
was a test for all of us.

26:01.960 --> 26:05.090
When Jiang Yubai finally
gathered the courage to speak,

26:05.240 --> 26:07.680
all my worries dissolved into thin air.

26:10.110 --> 26:11.920
No one pressed him for details,

26:12.400 --> 26:15.060
and he didn't need to
go out of his way to explain.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.680
Our care and understanding

26:18.160 --> 26:19.110
gave all the pain

26:19.110 --> 26:21.480
he could never speak of
a safe place to land.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.940
It felt like nothing had changed
between us.

26:24.550 --> 26:26.950
We were still the same as
when we were young.

26:39.160 --> 26:39.590
Tang.

26:40.920 --> 26:43.090
We're headed the same way.
Let's go home together.

26:43.090 --> 26:44.100
Same way, my foot.

26:44.240 --> 26:45.240
My place is right nearby.

26:45.240 --> 26:46.770
It's only a 10-minute walk.

26:46.790 --> 26:48.390
Go do whatever you need to do.

26:49.200 --> 26:50.440
But seriously,

26:50.830 --> 26:52.440
I was really surprised

26:52.680 --> 26:54.160
to see Jiang today.

26:54.830 --> 26:55.720
What?

26:56.070 --> 26:57.750
You're not happy to see him?

26:58.160 --> 26:59.310
How could I not be happy?

26:59.310 --> 27:00.640
We're all good friends.

27:01.510 --> 27:02.960
I just think... well...

27:03.920 --> 27:05.790
Jiang is really stubborn.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.680
It's just some debt.

27:07.920 --> 27:09.440
He didn't have to disappear for so long.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.790
He could've just told us,

27:10.790 --> 27:13.520
and we would've helped him
figure something out.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.790
What do you know?

27:15.160 --> 27:16.920
That's what a real man is.

27:17.270 --> 27:18.240
If it were you,

27:18.440 --> 27:19.510
you'd be making a huge fuss,

27:19.510 --> 27:20.920
wailing about it to the whole world.

27:20.920 --> 27:22.270
No way.

27:24.190 --> 27:25.590
But it's quite good now.

27:25.750 --> 27:27.680
We're all back together again.

27:28.160 --> 27:28.920
Perfect!

27:30.920 --> 27:31.850
I don't think so.

27:32.240 --> 27:34.680
I have a feeling trouble is coming.

27:35.550 --> 27:36.440
What?

27:36.720 --> 27:38.760
Didn't you notice at dinner today

27:38.830 --> 27:40.960
that Jiang Yubai and Shen Fuxuan
seemed a little off

27:40.960 --> 27:42.070
with each other?

27:42.070 --> 27:42.750
Off?

27:43.790 --> 27:45.680
They've always been like that.

27:46.720 --> 27:48.320
You're the one acting weird.

27:49.920 --> 27:52.050
There's no point explaining it to you.

27:56.000 --> 27:57.270
Didn't you tell me before

27:57.270 --> 27:59.680
that a bunch of investment firms wanted to
fund your bike-sharing project?

27:59.680 --> 28:00.440
Yeah.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.920
Then how come I haven't seen

28:01.920 --> 28:02.920
a single one of your bikes on the road?

28:02.920 --> 28:04.510
Are you just bragging to me?

28:05.920 --> 28:07.720
How could I be bragging?

28:08.010 --> 28:10.520
My e-bikes are just too popular.

28:10.550 --> 28:11.440
Everyone's riding them.

28:11.440 --> 28:13.040
That's why you don't see any.

28:13.510 --> 28:14.240
Oh, please.

28:14.240 --> 28:16.970
Sounds like you just
can't afford to put out more.

28:17.270 --> 28:19.070
You don't know
how the internet business model works,

28:19.070 --> 28:20.270
so stop running your mouth—

28:20.270 --> 28:21.470
especially about me.

28:22.240 --> 28:23.160
What about you?

28:23.720 --> 28:25.510
Didn't you brag to me a few days ago

28:25.510 --> 28:27.510
about how popular the kid
your agency is training has gotten

28:27.510 --> 28:29.200
and how he was about to
join a production crew?

28:29.200 --> 28:30.800
He hasn't joined yet, has he?

28:32.240 --> 28:33.970
Did that project fall through?

28:34.240 --> 28:35.920
What kid?

28:36.160 --> 28:37.960
Look who's talking, old fossil.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.480
Don't think I don't know anything.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.720
Of the kids your agency trains,

28:42.790 --> 28:45.000
not even one in a hundred can make it big.

28:45.310 --> 28:46.720
The best option is for you to go work

28:46.720 --> 28:48.400
with the top actress now.

28:48.720 --> 28:50.070
She has good resources,

28:50.070 --> 28:51.400
and it would help your career.

28:51.400 --> 28:53.660
It would also make things easier for you.

28:55.000 --> 28:56.510
Actually, you know what?

28:56.830 --> 28:57.960
My boss did ask me

28:57.960 --> 28:59.590
to manage Bingbing.

29:00.590 --> 29:02.790
He said she's gotten popular recently,
but they're short-staffed

29:02.790 --> 29:04.990
and need a reliable executive manager.

29:05.070 --> 29:06.160
Bingbing?

29:06.280 --> 29:07.410
She's my goddess.

29:07.440 --> 29:09.550
What a great opportunity.
You should take it!

29:09.550 --> 29:11.550
Why are you still thinking about it?

29:13.790 --> 29:15.320
I'm not going to manage her.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.590
You're not?

29:16.960 --> 29:17.750
Why?

29:18.920 --> 29:20.200
No reason.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.070
Su Mo trusts me,

29:22.070 --> 29:23.790
and I believe he can make it big.

29:23.790 --> 29:25.960
I just want to see someone like him grow.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.200
Grow?

29:27.790 --> 29:28.510
Tang Tingting,

29:28.510 --> 29:30.680
have you lost your mind or something?

29:31.200 --> 29:33.400
You're passing up a golden future

29:33.680 --> 29:34.590
for some nobody

29:34.750 --> 29:37.610
who may not even become famous
in a million years...

29:38.510 --> 29:40.840
Do you have feelings for him or something?

29:41.830 --> 29:43.680
Duan Qiyan, I'll manage whoever I want.

29:43.680 --> 29:44.720
And I can have feelings
for whoever I want.

29:44.720 --> 29:46.380
That's none of your business!

29:47.160 --> 29:47.920
Ridiculous.

29:56.510 --> 29:57.370
Jiang Yubai...

29:58.440 --> 29:59.900
You found him, didn't you?

30:01.790 --> 30:02.680
I knew it.

30:03.720 --> 30:05.400
Only you could bring him back.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.640
These past few years

30:09.030 --> 30:10.890
must've been really rough on him.

30:16.510 --> 30:17.720
But it's all over now,

30:18.000 --> 30:19.080
isn't it?

30:21.270 --> 30:22.800
Have you ever thought about

30:22.920 --> 30:24.920
what you would've done if you hadn't

30:25.200 --> 30:26.330
found him this time?

30:26.720 --> 30:28.120
I would've kept looking.

30:28.240 --> 30:29.030
For how long?

30:29.400 --> 30:30.530
Until I'd found him.

30:34.830 --> 30:36.360
He must have had his reasons

30:36.750 --> 30:37.920
for not showing up.

30:38.510 --> 30:39.440
But I believe

30:39.960 --> 30:41.420
he would never abandon us.

30:49.030 --> 30:50.430
We really are different.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.680
You're an optimist.

30:58.510 --> 30:59.370
I'm going home.

31:00.220 --> 31:01.420
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

31:17.290 --> 31:26.800
[Class Break]

31:18.030 --> 31:19.030
Jiang is back on the team.

31:19.030 --> 31:20.760
We're finally complete again!

31:21.350 --> 31:23.200
Happy! We made it home safely!

31:33.150 --> 31:42.020
[Class Break]

31:38.750 --> 31:39.550
Welcome back.

32:01.600 --> 32:04.100
[Class Break]

32:06.450 --> 32:06.780
[Class Break]

32:06.780 --> 32:10.850
[Yubai]

32:22.840 --> 32:27.560
[Yubai]

32:31.920 --> 32:32.580
Good night.

32:40.750 --> 32:41.680
Sweet dreams.

33:06.400 --> 33:08.600
Manager Xie, please make an exception.

33:08.920 --> 33:12.240
Our project really needs the supercomputer
to process the data.

33:12.240 --> 33:13.920
That priority project you just mentioned—

33:13.920 --> 33:15.380
isn't that Tan Qianche's?

33:15.720 --> 33:17.170
He's not trying to catch up
on the schedule at all.

33:17.170 --> 33:18.550
He's just hogging the machine on purpose

33:18.550 --> 33:19.550
so we can't use it.

33:20.510 --> 33:22.460
Don't say such things to others.

33:22.920 --> 33:24.380
Team Leader Tan's project

33:24.400 --> 33:25.940
has always been the university's

33:25.940 --> 33:27.790
top-priority project this semester.

33:27.790 --> 33:28.510
Yes.

33:28.750 --> 33:30.590
It has reached a critical stage again,

33:30.590 --> 33:32.680
so it's understandable for him
to try to get back on schedule.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.920
But we booked the time slots long ago.

33:35.070 --> 33:36.510
Why can't we use it?

33:38.180 --> 33:39.750
That doesn't count anymore.

33:39.750 --> 33:40.920
Starting today,

33:40.920 --> 33:43.680
Team Leader Tan's project has exclusive use
of the supercomputer room 24/7.

33:43.680 --> 33:44.680
This is a decision made by the department.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.310
Then...

33:45.330 --> 33:47.420
Alright, don't waste your time here.

33:47.550 --> 33:48.950
There's nothing I can do.

33:50.960 --> 33:53.240
Tan Qianche is being way too unreasonable.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.200
I know him.

33:54.270 --> 33:55.200
As long as he wants to,

33:55.200 --> 33:56.920
he can block every path for us.

33:57.070 --> 34:00.200
Unless we stop using
any of the university's resources.

34:00.200 --> 34:02.440
But without the university's resources,

34:02.440 --> 34:04.510
where else are we supposed to turn?

34:08.590 --> 34:10.790
I'm definitely going to graduate late.

34:12.440 --> 34:14.960
Enough. What's the use of complaining?

34:15.510 --> 34:17.310
Let's listen to the team leader.

34:18.360 --> 34:19.110
Team Leader,

34:20.280 --> 34:21.540
do you have a solution?

34:23.960 --> 34:25.820
I've given it some rough thought.

34:26.550 --> 34:29.400
If we divide the core data
that needs to be run by the supercomputer

34:29.400 --> 34:30.360
into modules,

34:31.150 --> 34:33.150
then we need to evaluate two things:

34:34.040 --> 34:36.170
first, whether regular equipment can

34:36.190 --> 34:38.250
handle the modules after splitting;

34:38.360 --> 34:40.280
and second, how much data transfer

34:40.280 --> 34:41.880
occurs between the modules.

34:43.070 --> 34:45.360
If we can solve those two problems,

34:46.030 --> 34:47.920
we won't need the supercomputer—

34:48.440 --> 34:49.440
we can compute the parts separately

34:49.440 --> 34:51.500
and integrate the results at the end.

34:52.440 --> 34:53.370
That could work.

34:55.030 --> 34:55.960
If

34:56.360 --> 34:58.320
we use ordinary computers

34:58.510 --> 34:59.910
to run the AI algorithms,

34:59.920 --> 35:00.800
it should work.

35:01.150 --> 35:03.110
Zhixia, I knew you'd have a way.

35:03.110 --> 35:03.880
Luo Ying,

35:04.280 --> 35:05.360
but this algorithm is far too

35:05.360 --> 35:07.440
demanding for the people who operate it.

35:07.440 --> 35:09.840
Only you and Team Leader Lin
can pull it off.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.320
A weakling like me

35:11.400 --> 35:13.130
would just mess it up if I tried.

35:14.510 --> 35:15.710
Still, we have to try.

35:15.880 --> 35:17.610
There's no other way right now.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.960
Otherwise, we'll just have to watch

35:19.960 --> 35:21.420
our project fall through.

35:21.630 --> 35:23.430
We'll have nowhere else to turn,

35:23.630 --> 35:25.960
and Shuwen's graduation will be delayed.

35:27.190 --> 35:28.360
So we can't give up.

35:29.400 --> 35:30.190
Right.

35:30.510 --> 35:32.040
Don't be so down, everyone.

35:32.430 --> 35:34.880
Isn't Tan Qianche just waiting to
laugh at us?

35:34.880 --> 35:37.190
The more discouraged we are,
the more smug he gets.

35:37.190 --> 35:38.920
Don't let him get what he wants.

35:39.630 --> 35:41.960
Forget it. Quit trying to hype me up.

35:42.150 --> 35:43.190
Just think about it—

35:43.190 --> 35:45.000
how many times more work is this

35:45.000 --> 35:46.800
without the supercomputer?

35:47.110 --> 35:49.370
Just thinking about it makes me despair.

36:13.110 --> 36:13.880
Shui.

36:16.150 --> 36:17.510
Are you hurting again?

36:18.000 --> 36:19.000
Leave me alone.

36:21.880 --> 36:22.960
I'll call Dr. Huang.

36:22.960 --> 36:23.710
Don't.

36:27.110 --> 36:29.510
I know it's his daughter's birthday today.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.880
I don't want to disappoint her.

36:44.880 --> 36:45.940
What are you doing?

36:46.440 --> 36:48.640
Aren't you going to check the next ward?

36:49.070 --> 36:50.270
Yours is the last one.

36:54.140 --> 36:56.000
I'm no good at comforting people.

36:56.390 --> 36:58.250
I'll just sit with you for a while.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.800
Don't just sit there.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.110
Say something.

37:23.320 --> 37:24.880
Distract me a little.

37:26.920 --> 37:28.250
I don't know what to say.

37:30.630 --> 37:33.000
Anything is fine.

37:34.630 --> 37:36.230
Even if you just make a sound.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.510
Please.

37:48.190 --> 37:51.070
Cell reprogramming
and transdifferentiation

37:51.800 --> 37:53.590
are among the key research areas

37:53.590 --> 37:55.150
in regenerative medicine.

37:55.880 --> 37:57.710
This guy really is something.

38:04.320 --> 38:07.190
"The late emperor was taken from us
before he could finish his life's work.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.770
Now, this world is divided into three,

38:08.770 --> 38:10.000
and Yi Province is in dire straits.

38:10.000 --> 38:12.710
This is truly a critical moment
of survival or ruin.

38:12.710 --> 38:14.630
They remember the generous treatment
they received from the late emperor,

38:14.630 --> 38:18.290
and they wish to repay his kindness
by serving Your Majesty well."

38:18.550 --> 38:19.880
Once upon a time,

38:20.360 --> 38:23.030
there was a little match girl.

38:24.920 --> 38:25.590
She...

38:27.960 --> 38:29.880
She was out selling matches,

38:30.280 --> 38:32.280
but no one wanted to buy them.

38:33.070 --> 38:33.880
And then...

39:22.630 --> 39:24.960
As soon as they heard about
splitting the data,

39:24.960 --> 39:27.290
the team members all started backing out.

39:27.590 --> 39:28.310
Really?

39:30.770 --> 39:33.440
Shuwen is so worried he won't
graduate on time that he's panicking.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.510
Shasha too.

39:34.510 --> 39:36.710
She has no confidence in herself at all.

39:39.630 --> 39:40.920
I understand them.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.800
But for our project to continue,

39:43.800 --> 39:44.930
this is the only way.

39:46.730 --> 39:48.330
Pass me the insulating tape.

39:53.800 --> 39:55.840
Senior Luo Ying left Tan Qianche's team

39:55.840 --> 39:57.440
for my project.

39:58.710 --> 40:00.630
I must get this project done.

40:01.000 --> 40:03.330
Otherwise, I'd feel like I'd failed them.

40:04.150 --> 40:05.550
Get me 10 more screws.

40:10.590 --> 40:11.460
Later,

40:11.590 --> 40:14.110
I need to have a serious talk
with Shasha and Shuwen.

40:14.110 --> 40:16.310
Based on their individual situations,

40:16.320 --> 40:17.920
I'll adjust the project plan

40:18.510 --> 40:20.970
and lower the difficulty
for Shasha's part.

40:35.510 --> 40:36.970
Am I disturbing your work?

40:37.050 --> 40:38.010
Of course not.

40:38.960 --> 40:40.820
Pass me the screwdriver. Thanks.

40:43.880 --> 40:44.880
Which one?

40:45.400 --> 40:46.660
The one on the far left.

40:48.710 --> 40:49.920
The supercomputer room has been occupied.

40:49.920 --> 40:51.320
Everyone is in a bad mood,

40:51.630 --> 40:53.090
and it's affecting me too.

40:53.510 --> 40:54.770
I don't know what to do.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.710
Didn't you just say it?

40:59.150 --> 41:00.510
Talk to them first,

41:00.960 --> 41:02.590
understand their specific situations,

41:02.590 --> 41:03.720
and then make a plan.

41:04.710 --> 41:05.710
You're so smart.

41:05.730 --> 41:07.280
You can solve any problem.

41:07.960 --> 41:09.110
So right now,

41:09.150 --> 41:12.110
I'm only concerned about
your mood and emotional well-being.

41:12.110 --> 41:13.630
After all,
even the smartest person's efficiency

41:13.630 --> 41:14.880
can suffer

41:15.070 --> 41:16.670
when they're in a bad mood.

41:19.670 --> 41:20.550
You're right.

41:20.840 --> 41:23.190
My mood is affecting my work right now.

41:24.670 --> 41:28.130
I shouldn't have let other people's moods
affect me like this.

41:30.880 --> 41:32.360
Then do you have any way

41:32.360 --> 41:33.620
to make me feel better?

41:45.190 --> 41:46.650
When you're feeling down,

41:47.400 --> 41:48.660
have something sweet.

41:57.190 --> 41:58.110
It's so sweet.

42:00.440 --> 42:01.300
How about this?

42:01.710 --> 42:03.710
Take this whole box back to your lab.

42:03.840 --> 42:06.040
Whenever you're feeling down, eat one.

42:07.360 --> 42:08.000
Thank you.

42:24.250 --> 42:27.710
[Results Integration: Lin Zhixia]

42:27.740 --> 42:34.260
[Data Splitting: Luo Ying]

42:33.400 --> 42:34.150
Zhixia.

42:35.150 --> 42:37.710
Are you really going to
take on most of the computing tasks?

42:37.710 --> 42:39.190
I can help you more with that.

42:39.190 --> 42:39.840
Do you...

42:39.840 --> 42:40.590
It's fine.

42:40.670 --> 42:42.500
[Results Integration: Lin Zhixia]

42:41.710 --> 42:43.110
Just stick to your assigned tasks.

42:42.530 --> 42:44.690
[Data Splitting: Luo Ying]

42:56.110 --> 42:58.070
CL is 0.3170, right?

42:58.070 --> 42:58.590
But...

42:58.840 --> 42:59.550
your...

43:04.070 --> 43:05.800
Team Leader, here is my report.

43:05.960 --> 43:06.690
Team Leader.

43:07.440 --> 43:08.190
Good job.

43:10.000 --> 43:12.060
I've finished all the calculations.

43:13.070 --> 43:13.710
Zhixia.

43:14.550 --> 43:15.800
Don't work too late by yourself.

43:15.800 --> 43:16.280
Okay.

43:16.280 --> 43:17.280
Remember to rest.

43:25.880 --> 43:27.360
Enter this data for me.

43:27.510 --> 43:28.110
Okay.

43:28.150 --> 43:28.960
Shasha.

43:32.880 --> 43:35.360
I've proved that the curve of 129 and Y

43:35.360 --> 43:36.840
equals the curve of X2.

43:36.840 --> 43:38.710
But you haven't calculated this value.

43:38.710 --> 43:39.360
Actually, we can...

43:39.360 --> 43:42.030
Are the values
for sections 3 and 4 accurate?

43:50.190 --> 43:52.120
I ordered bubble tea for everyone.

43:52.190 --> 43:52.840
Here.

43:53.960 --> 43:54.670
Thank you.

43:54.670 --> 43:55.600
You're welcome.

43:56.590 --> 43:57.320
Team Leader.

44:01.030 --> 44:01.710
Thank you.

44:01.710 --> 44:02.640
You're welcome.

44:02.670 --> 44:03.800
You're the best.

44:04.710 --> 44:05.630
Thank you.

44:09.590 --> 44:10.360
Luo Ying.

44:10.630 --> 44:12.070
Okay, thanks. I'll drink it later.

44:12.070 --> 44:12.710
Okay.

44:16.840 --> 44:18.040
Everyone, keep it up!

44:18.510 --> 44:19.400
-We can do it!
-Keep going.

44:19.400 --> 44:20.150
Keep going.

44:29.740 --> 44:34.680
[Mom]

44:30.000 --> 44:32.670
Baihui, you said
you'd come home for dinner this weekend.

44:32.670 --> 44:33.930
Come back early today.

44:43.030 --> 44:44.260
Did you see my message?

44:43.310 --> 44:48.360
[Mom]

44:44.590 --> 44:46.050
What time will you be home?

45:12.710 --> 45:13.550
Hello, Mom.

45:13.840 --> 45:15.900
Didn't you see the message I sent you?

45:16.630 --> 45:17.360
I saw it.

45:17.360 --> 45:18.510
Um, I'm in class.

45:18.510 --> 45:20.510
I'll go back as soon as class is over.

45:20.590 --> 45:21.030
Okay.

45:21.230 --> 45:22.550
I'll tell your dad too.

45:22.880 --> 45:23.880
What do you want to eat?

45:23.880 --> 45:25.150
I'll go buy the ingredients later.

45:25.150 --> 45:26.150
Anything is fine.

45:26.360 --> 45:26.890
Alright.

45:41.710 --> 45:42.670
Chicken soup ramen, right?

45:42.670 --> 45:44.280
They make it pretty well.

45:44.300 --> 45:45.130
I think so.

45:45.880 --> 45:46.810
What did you say?

45:46.840 --> 45:48.960
-The plan still needs further discussion.
-Please, wait a minute.

45:48.960 --> 45:50.920
Right, if we're going to do this,
make it perfect.

45:50.920 --> 45:51.440
Right.

45:51.440 --> 45:53.440
Welcome. What would you like to eat?

45:53.920 --> 45:55.510
I'll definitely
have noodles again this time.

45:55.510 --> 45:57.280
But the one I had last time
tasted pretty good.

45:57.280 --> 45:59.550
This time, I'll try
the chicken soup one instead.

45:59.550 --> 46:00.320
Oh, right.

46:00.840 --> 46:02.440
Please put less soy sauce,

46:02.440 --> 46:04.150
no green onions, and no crispy seaweed.

46:04.150 --> 46:06.280
Also, an extra soft-boiled egg

46:06.280 --> 46:07.610
and some char siu for me.

46:07.920 --> 46:08.800
Okay. What about you?

46:08.800 --> 46:10.260
I'll have a regular ramen.

46:10.880 --> 46:12.880
So that's one regular ramen

46:12.880 --> 46:14.070
and one chicken soup ramen

46:14.070 --> 46:16.030
with no green onions or crispy seaweed,

46:16.030 --> 46:17.150
less soy sauce,

46:17.360 --> 46:19.280
plus a soft-boiled egg and char siu,

46:19.280 --> 46:19.880
right?

46:19.880 --> 46:20.920
Right, thanks.

46:21.110 --> 46:21.800
Okay.

46:24.150 --> 46:24.960
Um,

46:25.150 --> 46:26.920
3 bottles of soy milk for me.

46:27.190 --> 46:28.710
Sure, coming right up.

46:31.030 --> 46:31.920
So, the most important issue

46:31.920 --> 46:33.230
about that plan is...

46:53.440 --> 46:54.750
Make sure to rest
no matter how busy you are.

46:54.750 --> 46:58.060
[Jiang Yubai]

46:59.230 --> 47:01.660
[Yubai]

47:01.700 --> 47:02.730
[Jiang Yubai]

47:12.360 --> 47:13.110
Your ramen.

47:13.110 --> 47:13.840
Thank you.

47:14.280 --> 47:15.000
Your chicken soup ramen.

47:15.000 --> 47:15.550
Thanks.

47:15.550 --> 47:16.280
Mr. Duan, about...

47:16.280 --> 47:16.960
Hold on.

47:17.070 --> 47:18.000
Let's eat first.

47:18.070 --> 47:19.670
We need a full stomach
to have the energy to fight.

47:19.670 --> 47:21.280
If you're not into food,
you've got a problem.

47:21.280 --> 47:22.190
We can talk while we eat.

47:22.190 --> 47:23.800
Plus, the ramen the boss lady makes here

47:23.800 --> 47:25.460
is exceptionally delicious.

47:26.150 --> 47:27.550
Enjoy your meal, then.

47:27.800 --> 47:28.600
Wait a minute.

47:30.190 --> 47:32.190
Have a bottle of soy milk, boss lady.

47:33.670 --> 47:34.800
For me?

47:35.590 --> 47:37.850
Thanks for putting up with my fussiness.

47:40.670 --> 47:41.880
I'll accept it then.

47:45.320 --> 47:46.070
Actually...

47:47.150 --> 47:49.360
what you just suggested
definitely won't work.

47:49.360 --> 47:50.110
Why?

47:50.110 --> 47:53.240
We absolutely can't settle for
a second-best solution.

47:59.550 --> 48:01.630
But the KPIs are already set in stone.

48:02.840 --> 48:04.000
Technological upgrades

48:04.000 --> 48:06.000
are what we must strive for.

48:06.630 --> 48:08.150
You can't just focus on short-term gains

48:08.150 --> 48:09.030
and ignore the big picture.

48:09.030 --> 48:11.160
That doesn't make sense. Understand?

48:11.840 --> 48:13.710
Mr. Duan, actually, I support your idea.

48:13.710 --> 48:15.440
But the other shareholders...

48:15.440 --> 48:16.510
Don't worry about the others.

48:16.510 --> 48:17.710
You help me
stabilize things on their side.

48:17.710 --> 48:18.910
I'll handle the rest.

48:19.360 --> 48:20.110
Eat up.

48:20.110 --> 48:21.110
Okay, okay, okay.

48:22.880 --> 48:24.550
I understand your thoughts,

48:24.880 --> 48:26.810
but the most important thing is...

49:06.920 --> 49:07.710
Zhixia.

49:10.280 --> 49:11.070
You're here.

49:11.710 --> 49:13.040
Why are your eyes so red?

49:14.000 --> 49:15.670
You really can't keep
pulling all-nighters like this.

49:15.670 --> 49:18.000
Your body will give out
if you keep this up.

49:18.510 --> 49:20.370
So I'm going home to rest for a bit.

49:20.900 --> 49:23.070
Can you keep an eye on
the progress this morning?

49:23.070 --> 49:24.920
You're already like this.
Don't worry about those things.

49:24.920 --> 49:25.980
I'll take you home.

49:27.070 --> 49:29.270
I'll be worried if you're not in the lab.

49:29.800 --> 49:30.590
Fine.

49:30.670 --> 49:32.190
Hurry back and get some sleep.

49:32.190 --> 49:33.000
Bye.

49:48.590 --> 49:49.280
Zhixia!

49:51.070 --> 49:51.800
Zhixia!

49:59.810 --> 50:00.140
[Class Break]

50:01.230 --> 50:02.360
Zhixia fell down.

50:02.400 --> 50:03.860
She's in the hospital now.

50:19.920 --> 50:20.630
How is she?

50:20.840 --> 50:21.730
Is she alright?

50:22.320 --> 50:23.320
There's nothing serious.

50:23.320 --> 50:24.960
Just dizziness from extreme fatigue,

50:24.960 --> 50:25.760
a hairline fracture in her foot,

50:25.760 --> 50:26.820
and a slight fever.

50:26.880 --> 50:28.280
She'll be fine after a couple of days' rest
in the hospital.

50:28.280 --> 50:29.880
That sounds pretty serious.

50:30.070 --> 50:31.480
Can we go in and see her?

50:32.750 --> 50:33.800
The hospital has rules.

50:33.800 --> 50:35.150
Only one visit per day,

50:35.280 --> 50:37.280
and a maximum of two people at a time.

50:43.280 --> 50:44.880
There's still one spot left.

50:45.760 --> 50:46.550
Let me go in.
